  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable food systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our food systems struggle to provide the growing global population with affordable, healthy foods. They also create livelihood stresses and damage our natural environments. Our sustainable food systems team wants to support transitions to sustainable, resilient, equitable and inclusive food systems.Topics we look at include:The effects of EU policies on food systems in Africa, including the Farm to Fork StrategyGovernance of and finance for food systemsSustainability analysis of food systemsClimate adaptation and resilienceGender imbalances in food systems</narrative>
  </description>
